Description:
macOS updater framework. The full upstream license includes its bundled
third-party terms. The reviewed binary archive is staged outside the checkout;
its SHA-256 is 1a856d2a9edb8e628de88121d7be04cf0e2167f8641650b78fca00b14244cf27.
Only the dedicated beta channel embeds the framework.

Local Modifications:
None to the upstream binary archive or license. Blanc's native owner and policy
are separate canonical sources under blanc/browser/mac/.
